SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the per-operation success flag on the 26 patch operations
  - the showcase drawn for this port: About/Preview.png and About/ModIcon.png,
    with the Art/ sources and the engraving page behind them
  - the checker under _tools/ and the test scenarios
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The 67 coats, their chances and the 201
textures are purpleyam's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2560113727

No explicit licence or redistribution permission was found in the sources
inspected on 2026-09-12; none is granted here for that original material.
Credit, a link to the original and removal on request
are commitments, not a grant of permission. See ATTRIBUTION.md for the audit scope.

The animals themselves are neither purpleyam's nor mine: they belong to Spino's
Megafauna. This mod patches its animal definitions at load time and ships
purpleyam's alternate textures; the original description credits Spino for
the base textures. Permission for that underlying artwork is not established.

If purpleyam asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
